      "description": "LUMA is a performance chord synthesiser built for musicians who want to play, not program.\n\nTap a chord and shape the sound to start your next track. LUMA is designed to be picked up and played instantly, whether you're writing, jamming, or performing live.\n\nPlay\n• Performance pad for expressive real-time control\n• ARP with multiple patterns and tempo control\n• LATCH mode to hold chords hands-free\n\nRecord\n• REC mode with loop and file capture\n• Export recordings directly from the app\n\nConnect\n• Full MIDI support\n• Bluetooth controller support\n• Works seamlessly with your existing setup and DAW\n\nLUMA is part of the Electric Phantoms app ecosystem.",
